{title: Fuego suave}
{key: G}
{meta: category Espíritu-Santo}

{start_of_verse}
[G]Tus dedos tocan [C]mi [D]pensar
Cariño en mi [Bm]alma[Em]
Sosiega y [Am]calma
[D]Mi vida [G]agitada.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
[G]Hoy tu presencia [C]me [D]abraza
Me quedo [Bm]en [Em]ella
Es tuya esta [Am]hora
[D]Estoy [G]naciendo
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Te adoraré [C]Espíritu [D]Santo[Bm]
Fuego [C]suave [D]abrasador
Dulce huésped del [G]alma (2)
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
[G]Mis ojos cantan [C]al [D]llorar
[Bm]Arrepentidos[Em]
Oveja [Am]perdida
[D]Queriendo [G]volver
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
[G]Aprecia el canto que [C]te [D]doy
Toma [Bm]mis [Em]palabras
Nostalgias del [Am]alma
[D]Sedienta de [G]amor.
{end_of_verse}
